    "updated_at": "2022-01-07T00:39:31Z",
    "body": "Some operating systems impose limitations on how much data can be part of pending USB transactions. If you check about://device-log you should see the low-level operating system error which triggered the `DOMException`. I recommend splitting your data into smaller transactions and only submitting a few at a time. In addition to avoiding operating system limitations it will also reduce the amount of memory used and allow your application to report progress as the transfers complete.",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "pin": null,
