    "body": "I think he means that Google fastboot is sending 500MB buffer to usb everytime.\r\nHere is the [code](https://android.googlesource.com/platform/system/core/+/refs/heads/master/fastboot/fastboot_driver.cpp#526)\r\nYou can see it uses `static constexpr uint32_t MAX_MAP_SIZE = 512 * 1024 * 1024;`\r\n\r\nBut after detailed review,  the real usb_linux.cpp uses 16KB buffer to send it. So case closed\r\n",
